<title>OMAN: Oman National Dairy 1996 profits fall.</title>
<headline>Oman National Dairy 1996 profits fall.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996</p>
<p>			 (Omani rials, rounded)</p>
<p> Net profit		    139,526  vs    192,791</p>
<p> Turnover		    7,740,101  vs  7,377,856</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		145,526  vs    207,391</p>
<p>Profits attributable to</p>
<p> shareholders		  286,393  vs    491,146</p>
<p> Proposed cash dividends   nil	vs    125,000</p>
<p> Proposed bonus shares     120,000  vs    200,000</p>
<p>Note- Full name is Oman National Dairy Co.</p>
</text>
